[38;2;124;124;124mThe standard proof: For a Hamiltonian path 0 = p_0, p_1, ..., p_n on {0, 1, ...,[0m[38;2;124;124;124mn}, the total distance D = sum |p_{i+1} - p_i| <= n(n+1)/2.[0m

